In fond loving memory of EUROS Jones of Mydroilyn & Mumbles
(Feb 1931 - May 2017)
A wonderful gentleman & beloved husband of Elsie; father of Andrew & Angela;
father-in-law to Paul & Ashy; "gramps" to Ben, Vicky, Cassi, Max & James;
& great grandfather to Sophia, Ella & Hannah......
You will forever remain our Sunshine...... xxx
